  "description": "Simple.AutoMapper – Simple.AutoMapper is a tool that automatically “copies data from one shape to another” inside your app. Instead of manually moving the same information between database objects and view models, you define simple mapping rules once and reuse them everywhere.",
  "iconFile": "Simple.Mapper.png",
