  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.8\n - Add ISimpleMapper interface and SimpleMapper for dependency injection\n - Add IServiceCollection.AddSimpleMapper() extension method - automatically registers ISimpleMapper as singleton\n - Add MapperConfiguration class for fluent profile configuration\n - Support constructor injection: inject ISimpleMapper into controllers/services\n - Support AddSimpleMapper(cfg => cfg.AddProfile<T>()) pattern\n - Support assembly scanning: AddSimpleMapper(typeof(Profile).Assembly)\n - Available for netstandard2.1, net8.0, net9.0 (DI features)\n - All existing v1.0.7 features remain compatible\n - Targets: netstandard2.0, netstandard2.1, net8.0, net9.0",
  "repository": "",
  "title": "Simple.AutoMapper — High-performance object simple mapping for .NET",
